docs {
  # POST /api/sales/done/ — Invalid confirmation

  Demonstrates validation and state errors. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:137-222`.

  ## Status codes

  - `400 Bad Request` — missing arrival fields or already paid
  - `401 Unauthorized` — invalid `sale_stripe_code` or token

  ## Response (401) — invalid stripe_code

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid sale data",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```

  ## Response (400) — missing fields

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid sale data",
    "data": {
      "arrival_date": ["Este campo es requerido."],
      "sale_stripe_code": ["Este campo es requerido."]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Response (400) — already paid

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Sale already paid",
    "data": []
  }
  ```

  `views.py:162` checks `sale.paid` after first confirmation.

  ## Notes

  - `sale_stripe_code` is required — copy from `POST /api/sales/` `201` via `{{stripe_code}}`.
}
